     "debunk_text": "# Will the COVID Vaccine Leave You with a Microchip?\n## Channel: University of Maryland Medical System\n3.76K subscribers\n8 likes\n\n### Description\n1,537 views\nPosted: 2021-11-09\nThere are questions in the community about the COVID vaccine. Some people think the government is implanting microchips with every vaccine given. We found an expert to set the record straight. There are no chips!\n\nLearn More: [...] ### Transcript\n[0:00] it's time to end colby and it's definitely time to get vaccinated there's some myths and misinformation about the vaccine that's stopping people\n[0:07] getting vaccinated so we're gonna see what quest is out there hey hey do you have any questions about the vaccine it sounds fake i heard you\n[0:14] get microchipped with every vaccination let's get to the facts dr gunyan fact of fiction with every shot you are [...] [0:21] being chipped that is fiction sounds like a science fiction plot but you can go get some potato chips with me after\n[0:28] you get this vaccine so no one is being implanted with a chip well there you have it every time you get the vaccine\n[0:35] you're not being chipped so let's go get this vaccine and let's end this virus\n[0:40] [Music]\n[0:49] you",
