     "claim_text": "If we had a flu pandemic hit tomorrow, if you use the egg-based technology, it would take 18 months to produce enough flu vaccine for that pandemic strain to cover a quarter of the world's population.",
     "verdict": "FAKE_NEWS_WEB",
     "addresses": "yes",
