     ],
     "evidence_origin": "web",
     "retrieved_at": "2026-11-11T01:27:52Z",
     "web_decision": "corpus did not address the claim; query=\"Columbia engineers injectable medical microchip announced May\""
    },
    {
     "window": 2,
     "claim_text": "It's about the size of a single grain of salt.",
     "verdict": "NO_EVIDENCE",
     "addresses": "no",
     "stance": "asserting",
     "flagged_phrase": "",
     "reason": "",
     "evidence_id": "WEB-1",
     "debunk_text": "About 1.8 million ions, alternately sodium and chloride, line each edge of a grain 0.5 millimeters wide. The whole grain holds about 5.5 × 1018 ions, or 5.5 billion billion.\n\n## How table salt is made\n\nTable salt such as Morton's is vacuum pan salt. In 2019, nearly all vacuum pan salt made in the United States came from underground salt beds. Water pumped down dissolves the salt, and the salty water, called brine, is brought up and heated, sometimes under a vacuum, until the water evaporates. [...] Return to Scale View\n\nAbout us\n\n## Share This Page\n\nTwitter\n\nTwitter\n\nReddit\n\nReddit\n\nEmail\n\nEmail\n\n# How big is a Grain of Salt?\n\n500 micrometers!\n\nView History Report\n\nGrain of Salt\n\nA grain of salt is a tiny crystal of sodium chloride, the compound that table salt is made of. Morton's iodized table salt is mostly cubes 0.2–0.6 millimeters across. The explorer shows a grain 0.5 millimeters, or 500 micrometers, wide. A micrometer is a millionth of a meter.\n\n## Size [...] ## Size\n\nSalt makers sort their grains with screens, sieves with holes of a set size. Morton's iodized table salt is taken from the middle size range of the salt Morton produces. No more than 5% of it is caught by a screen with holes 600 micrometers wide, and no more than 9% falls through holes 212 micrometers wide. So at least 86% of it is in grains between 0.2 and 0.6 millimeters across.",
     "evidence_source": "scaleofuniverse.com — https://scaleofuniverse.com/en/universe/grain-of-salt",
     "evidence_url": "https://scaleofuniverse.com/en/universe/grain-of-salt",
     "similarity": null,
     "retrieved_ids": [
