     "debunk_text": "2021). Generally, concerns about the safety of vaccines in pregnancy could be attributed to the generic immunological and inflammatory response that could impact foetal implantation and embryogenesis (Arora and Lakshmi, 2021; Moodley et al., 2021). However, in the case of COVID-19 mRNA vaccines, there were concerns disseminated on social media platforms claiming higher risk of",
